<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Life Bancorp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Life Bancorp started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interstate/Johnson Lane said it initiated coverage of Life Bancorp Inc with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $29.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 1-1/4 to 26.</p>
<p>-- initiated Virginia Beach Federal Financial Corp with a buy and a target of $16. The stock was up 1/8 at 13.</p>
</text>
